   $q$In paragraph 1, "The Sun gives off a huge amount of energy." Which word means almost the same as "huge"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"bright","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"related-not-synonym"},{"text":"warm","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"related-not-synonym"},{"text":"enormous","is_correct":true},{"text":"tiny","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"antonym-for-synonym"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$enormous$q$, $q$"Huge" and "enormous" both mean very large. The Sun is bright and warm, but those words do not mean the same as "huge."$q$, 'draft', '51875581-56e4-51ee-b6f8-322c64214379')
