   $q$What is the main idea of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Cities use many machines to keep their streets safe and clean.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-broad"},{"text":"Smart traffic lights sense cars and people so they change when needed.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Some traffic lights use a loop of wire buried under the road.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Cities should get rid of all the old traffic lights right away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Smart traffic lights sense cars and people so they change when needed.$q$, $q$The passage explains how smart lights sense traffic with wires, cameras, and buttons, and how this helps people. The wire loop is just one of those tools.$q$, 'draft', '623f3c58-e6ba-5a0b-bc8c-52aee748a175')
