   $q$How is this passage mainly organized?$q$, $q$[{"text":"As the reasons why riding a bike is good exercise for kids","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-structure"},{"text":"As one town's problem with bikes and how the town fixed it","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-structure"},{"text":"In time order, from the earliest bicycle to the bikes of today","is_correct":true},{"text":"As a comparison between bicycles and cars on city streets","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-structure"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In time order, from the earliest bicycle to the bikes of today$q$, $q$The passage moves from 1817 to the 1860s, the 1870s, the 1880s and then today. Cars are never mentioned, so it is not a comparison of bikes and cars.$q$, 'draft', '23a18cf8-f30a-587c-91b7-498afc0af8f8')
