   $q$Which sentence best states the theme of the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A team does better when players share and work together.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Basketball practice is more fun than playing in real games.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Passing drills are slow and make players tired of the game.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"character-view-not-theme"},{"text":"The best shooter on a team should always take the last shot.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-of-theme"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A team does better when players share and work together.$q$, $q$Rafael's pass to Mei wins the game, and he learns that sharing the ball works. He thinks passing feels slow at first, but that is his early view, not the lesson of the story.$q$, 'draft', '3fc6bbe0-35ac-56ac-a5dc-0ff8ee458b7d')
