   $q$What is the theme of the poem?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Snowstorms are dangerous, so people should stay inside.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Children should help only when an adult asks them to.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"One small kindness can spread and bring neighbors together.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Cookies are the very best way to say thank you.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$One small kindness can spread and bring neighbors together.$q$, $q$One child shovels one walk, and by the end the whole block helps and "every neighbor is a friend." The speaker helps without being asked, so the choice about helping only when an adult asks goes against the poem.$q$, 'draft', '1b581b42-04f5-5c12-86b9-cbf174f5c5e0')
